Z||000000||johnmac||06-15-2000||07:39 PM||||I need HELP.<P>I have isolated a short in my red power wire running down the middle of the car. From the transmission lever forward to around the back of the radio/HVAC pod and the instrument panel - -somewhere the red power wire is shorting out to ground. I've checked the fuse panel and all my red power wires are shorted out. Checked out all my possible connections for possible ground touches - - nothing. HELP - - HAS ANYONE HAD THIS PROBLEM AND WHAT SHOULD I DO. <P>Thanks,<P>John MacHaffie||||reg||11
