Z||000003||johnmac||06-16-2000||07:09 AM||||An additional question? Should my red power line and the fuse box indicate continuity to ground? A statement from above indicates a ground at the sensors. Is a faulty sensor giving me a ground connection?<P>I have power but disturbed by my meter reading.<P>HELP!!<P>John MacHaffie||||reg||1
